@startuml cad-contract
!include theme.iuml
title CAD core — ensure geometry once, request evidence repeatedly
autonumber

participant "Caller\nCLI / test harness / adapter" as Caller
participant "Evaluator supervisor" as Eval
participant "FreeCAD build process\ngenerated model.py" as Build #F9E4E2
participant "Retained clean FreeCAD runtime\nimmutable loaded geometry" as Verify
database "Native snapshots +\nprivate query result directories" as Run

Caller -> Eval : ensure_geometry(source files / native bundle)
Eval -> Eval : validate / freeze inputs; compute build key
note over Caller, Run
  Build key: source, build parameters, declared inputs, native versions/settings.
  Views, annotations, metrics and exports do not change geometry identity.
  Source-based evaluate remains a convenience that ensures and queries in one call.
end note

alt compatible geometry already loaded
  Eval -> Verify : reuse immutable cached geometry
else compatible native snapshot available
  Eval -> Run : read native bundle + provenance
  Eval -> Verify : restore native geometry without executing source
else source explicitly supplied
  Eval -> Build : invoke build(parameters, local input paths)
  Build --> Eval : staged native bundle / feature map, or build error
  Eval -> Run : freeze native snapshot + provenance, if available
  Eval -> Verify : load available native geometry; never run generated code here
end
Verify --> Eval : live geometry_handle + geometry digest, or diagnostics
Eval --> Caller : ensure result + handle / native snapshot reference

opt geometry ensured
  loop subsequent evidence requests for this geometry
    Caller -> Eval : evaluate_geometry(handle, request, new output directory)
    Eval -> Verify : validate live handle; pin immutable geometry
    alt handle live and pinned
    opt PNG requested
      Verify -> Run : separate views / composed grids / both;\nJSON sidecars + inline labels from shared annotation records
    end
    opt measurements or checks requested
      Verify -> Run : computed values, units, targets, criteria, outcomes
    end
    opt STEP / GLB requested and supported
      Verify -> Run : requested exports + validation evidence
    end
    Verify --> Eval : independent artifact / annotation / metric outcomes
    Eval -> Verify : release query pin; retain geometry for another request
    else expired / released / unknown handle
      Verify --> Eval : geometry_unavailable; no source execution
    end
    Eval -> Run : finalize result.json atomically after completed files
    Eval --> Caller : local result path + query outcome
  end
  opt caller releases geometry
    Caller -> Eval : release_geometry(handle)
    Eval -> Verify : release cached state once no query pins it
  end
end

note over Caller, Run
  Handles are stable while live; expiry/restart is explicit, never a hidden source rebuild.
  Restore a retained native snapshot to obtain a new handle; query state never mutates geometry.
  Each query gets its own immutable result. Failed checks preserve useful evidence; STEP is optional.
  Titles appear at each view's top-left when inline annotations are selected; JSON keeps view/camera coordinates.
  No chat, ACP or MCP dependency inside this core. Message grouping belongs to the wrapper.
end note

legend bottom
  Review draft: docs/M-CAD.md, M-CAD-1–20 and M-CAD-31–36. Examples: cad/examples/cylinder/.
  One-shot CLI can read a native bundle; retained local runtimes/harnesses can use live handles.
  Separate diagram cad-handoff covers transfer, durable operations and publication.
  Local process boundaries are a development stage; Docker later enforces isolation (TRD-25, TRD-37).
endlegend
@enduml
